{
  "uid": "weather",
  "title": "Weather",
  "description": "Requirement 6, temperature and humidity only: the measured data has no pressure sensor. Alcohol3 and CH4 are bench rigs with no GPS, so this is a time series, not a geomap; a geomap needs synthetic, geo-tagged data and is deferred to phase 6.",
